Um, jaga hatimu, oke?

00:18:41.770 --> 00:18:42.770
Saya akan.

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:47.980
Baiklah, mari kita bungkus.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:48.900
Selamat tinggal, Clara.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:49.980
Selamat tinggal.

