Setiap satu.

00:27:06.410 --> 00:27:07.840
Apakah mereka matahari?

00:27:08.030 --> 00:27:09.370
Ada ratusan di antaranya.

00:27:09.450 --> 00:27:11.350
Lihat yang besar di sana?

00:27:11.430 --> 00:27:12.430
Itu bulan.

00:27:12.970 --> 00:27:18.540
Nah, kau bisa melihatnya karena ia memantulkan cahaya matahari seperti cermin.

00:27:19.050 --> 00:27:22.285
Jadi jika kau melihatnya seperti ini, matahari tidak pernah pergi.

00:27:22.400 --> 00:27:23.630
Ia selalu di sini.

00:27:24.030 --> 00:27:25.030
Wow.

00:27:25.720 --> 00:27:27.370
Sampai jumpa di pagi hari, sobat.

00:27:28.180 --> 00:27:29.180
Selamat malam.

00:27:48.320 --> 00:27:49.320
Aku turun.

00:27:50.660 --> 00:27:51.850
Aku turun.

00:27:53.360 --> 00:27:54.360
Aku turun.

00:28:20.060 --> 00:28:21.060
Itu gambar lucu.

